content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Garden Coordinator",
      "description": "Manages garden plots and activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plot Application",
      "description": "Request submitted by a resident to get a garden plot"
    },
    {
      "name": "End Of Season Report",
      "description": "Summary of garden activity and outcomes for the season"
    },
    {
      "name": "City Resident",
      "description": "Person who participates in the community garden"
    },
    {
      "name": "Garden Plot",
      "description": "Designated area for planting, tracking crops and assigned residents",
      "attributes": [
        "Crop",
        "Plot Assignment List"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Crop",
      "description": "Type of plant grown in a garden plot"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plot Assignment List",
      "description": "Tracks which residents are assigned to which plots",
      "attributes": [
        "City Resident"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pest Issue Report",
      "description": "Record of pest problems submitted by a resident or volunteer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Seed Exchange",
      "description": "Event where residents share seeds with each other"
    },
    {
      "name": "Compost",
      "description": "Organic material collected for enriching garden soil"
    },
    {
      "name": "Harvest Donation",
      "description": "Produce donated by residents to a community program"
    },
    {
      "name": "Harvest Share Program",
      "description": "Program that redistributes donated produce to the community"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agriculture Program",
      "description": "City-level initiative supporting urban gardening"
    },
    {
      "name": "Garden Fair",
      "description": "Community event to showcase garden activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Volunteer",
      "description": "Person helping with garden maintenance and events"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Day",
      "description": "Scheduled day when volunteers clean and maintain garden plots"
    },
    {
      "name": "Garden Inspection",
      "description": "Check to ensure plots are safe and meet environmental standards",
      "attributes": [
        "Garden Plot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Funding",
      "description": "Financial support provided for tools or materials"
    }
  ]
}
```
